1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
KANB AI Agropreneur: checking AI diagnosis against public plant-disease datasets

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
500 reference images in Neon; 168 real AI assessments; labels never sent to the AI

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Finding: the AI often misread the crop, so answers were generic

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Farmer flow: upload a photo of the affected leaf

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
New: choose Vegetables, then the exact crop (Tomato)

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Live AI result: crop correctly identified as Tomato, with likely issue and safe steps

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,000
70 images assessed both ways: crop 64% to 99%, correct disease in top 3 from 41% to 54%

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Safety rule: confident treatment for the wrong disease fell from 10% to 1.9%
